# No More Brave Faces
# Dialogic source. Line signals drive the cinematic layout and save checkpoints.
label line_0
[signal arg="line:0:Rin:protected"]
I am afraid the treatment will not work.
label line_1
[signal arg="line:1:You:protected"]
So am I.
label line_2
[signal arg="line:2:Rin:protected"]
You are allowed to say that?
label line_3
[signal arg="line:3:You:protected"]
I am learning.
label line_4
[signal arg="line:4:Rin:protected"]
Then I am afraid, and I am hopeful. Both can stay.
label line_5
[signal arg="line:5:Narrator:protected"]
You sit with the uncertainty until it becomes something you can carry together.
